    "evidence": "Title: 'Gene expression patterns in peripheral blood correlate with the extent of coronary artery disease'; Description discusses coronary artery disease (CAD) and Duke CAD index.",
    "justification": "The study addresses coronary artery disease (CAD); there is no mention of ALS, FTD, motor neuron disease, or related terms."
